---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Submit or correct — Minted & Gone">
  <article class="narrow longform panel" style="margin-top:48px">
    <p class="eyebrow">Corrections desk</p><h1>Suggest a missing marketplace</h1>
    <p>There is no live form in v0. Use the placeholder channels below when this project is wired to real intake.</p>
    <h2>What to include</h2><ul class="note-list"><li>Marketplace name, aliases, original URL, and domain.</li><li>Source URL for launch, closure, acquisition, merge, rebrand, or current availability.</li><li>Archive URL when available.</li><li>Notes for frontend status, contract status, asset status, and where users or assets went.</li><li>Reason the record is a marketplace, not only a collection, gallery, or price tracker.</li></ul>
    <h2>Placeholders</h2><p><a class="btn" href="https://example.invalid/google-form-placeholder">Google Form placeholder</a> <a class="btn" href="https://example.invalid/github-issue-placeholder">GitHub Issue placeholder</a></p>
    <p class="mock-note">No promotional listings. Submissions should be historical, sourced, and correction-friendly.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
